WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
Hahahaha

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,800
No need to panic

3
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:04,800
I salute you with auspicious rhyme

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,700
Gratitude to the Hidden Way of Heaven

5
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:08,600
Waiting for the right person here

6
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,300
You can make a contract with Cizi to come here

7
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,800
It's also your chance

8
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,600
I gave you these fish scales as a gift.

9
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,100
I can be free from now on

10
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:27,940
Hahahaha since it's okay

11
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:29,640
It’s better to find the exit quickly.

12
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:31,940
Then it’s time for Wu Gongmu and Shou to catch up.

13
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:34,980
Just bring me here

14
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:36,680
I never thought about how to leave.
